[
  {
    "content_id": "10059001001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各书 1:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59001001",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;作　神和主耶稣基督仆人的雅各请散住十二个支派之人的安。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059001002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各书 1:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59001002",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;我的弟兄们，你们落在百般试炼中，都要以为大喜乐；</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059001003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各书 1:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59001003",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;因为知道你们的信心经过试验，就生忍耐。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059001004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各书 1:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59001004",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;但忍耐也当成功，使你们成全、完备，毫无缺欠。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059001005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各书 1:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59001005",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;你们中间若有缺少智慧的，应当求那厚赐与众人、也不斥责人的　神，主就必赐给他。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059001006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各书 1:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59001006",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;只要凭着信心求，一点不疑惑；因为那疑惑的人，就像海中的波浪，被风吹动翻腾。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059001007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各书 1:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59001007",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;这样的人不要想从主那里得什么。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059001008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各书 1:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59001008",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;心怀二意的人，在他一切所行的路上都没有定见。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059001009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各书 1:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59001009",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;卑微的弟兄升高，就该喜乐；</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059001010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各书 1:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59001010",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;富足的降卑，也该如此；因为他必要过去，如同草上的花一样。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059001011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各书 1:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59001011",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;太阳出来，热风刮起，草就枯干，花也凋谢，美容就消没了；那富足的人，在他所行的事上也要这样衰残。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059001012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各书 1:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59001012",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;忍受试探的人是有福的，因为他经过试验以后，必得生命的冠冕；这是主应许给那些爱他之人的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059001013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各书 1:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59001013",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;人被试探，不可说：「我是被　神试探」；因为　神不能被恶试探，他也不试探人。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059001014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各书 1:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59001014",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;但各人被试探，乃是被自己的私欲牵引诱惑的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059001015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各书 1:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59001015",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;私欲既怀了胎，就生出罪来；罪既长成，就生出死来。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059001016",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各书 1:16",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59001016",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>16</sup>&nbsp;我亲爱的弟兄们，不要看错了。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059001017",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各书 1:17",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59001017",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>17</sup>&nbsp;各样美善的恩赐和各样全备的赏赐都是从上头来的，从众光之父那里降下来的；在他并没有改变，也没有转动的影儿。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059001018",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各书 1:18",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59001018",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>18</sup>&nbsp;他按自己的旨意，用真道生了我们，叫我们在他所造的万物中好像初熟的果子。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059001019",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各书 1:19",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59001019",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>19</sup>&nbsp;我亲爱的弟兄们，这是你们所知道的。但你们各人要快快地听，慢慢地说，慢慢地动怒，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059001020",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各书 1:20",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59001020",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>20</sup>&nbsp;因为人的怒气并不成就　神的义。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059001021",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各书 1:21",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59001021",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>21</sup>&nbsp;所以，你们要脱去一切的污秽和盈余的邪恶，存温柔的心领受那所栽种的道，就是能救你们灵魂的道。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059001022",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各书 1:22",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59001022",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>22</sup>&nbsp;只是你们要行道，不要单单听道，自己欺哄自己。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059001023",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各书 1:23",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59001023",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>23</sup>&nbsp;因为听道而不行道的，就像人对着镜子看自己本来的面目，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059001024",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各书 1:24",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59001024",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>24</sup>&nbsp;看见，走后，随即忘了他的相貌如何。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059001025",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各书 1:25",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59001025",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>25</sup>&nbsp;惟有详细察看那全备、使人自由之律法的，并且时常如此，这人既不是听了就忘，乃是实在行出来，就在他所行的事上必然得福。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059001026",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各书 1:26",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59001026",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>26</sup>&nbsp;若有人自以为虔诚，却不勒住他的舌头，反欺哄自己的心，这人的虔诚是虚的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059001027",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各书 1:27",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59001027",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>27</sup>&nbsp;在　神我们的父面前，那清洁没有玷污的虔诚，就是看顾在患难中的孤儿寡妇，并且保守自己不沾染世俗。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059002001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各书 2:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59002001",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;我的弟兄们，你们信奉我们荣耀的主耶稣基督，便不可按着外貌待人。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059002002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各书 2:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59002002",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;若有一个人带着金戒指，穿着华美衣服，进你们的会堂去；又有一个穷人穿着肮脏衣服也进去；</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059002003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各书 2:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59002003",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;你们就重看那穿华美衣服的人，说：「请坐在这好位上」；又对那穷人说：「你站在那里」，或「坐在我脚凳下边。」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059002004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各书 2:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59002004",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;这岂不是你们偏心待人，用恶意断定人吗？</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059002005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各书 2:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59002005",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;我亲爱的弟兄们，请听，　神岂不是拣选了世上的贫穷人，叫他们在信上富足，并承受他所应许给那些爱他之人的国吗？</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059002006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各书 2:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59002006",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;你们反倒羞辱贫穷人。那富足人岂不是欺压你们、拉你们到公堂去吗？</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059002007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各书 2:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59002007",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;他们不是亵渎你们所敬奉的尊名吗？</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059002008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各书 2:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59002008",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;经上记着说：「要爱人如己。」你们若全守这至尊的律法才是好的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059002009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各书 2:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59002009",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;但你们若按外貌待人，便是犯罪，被律法定为犯法的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059002010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各书 2:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59002010",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;因为凡遵守全律法的，只在一条上跌倒，他就是犯了众条。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059002011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各书 2:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59002011",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;原来那说「不可奸淫」的，也说「不可杀人」；你就是不奸淫，却杀人，仍是成了犯律法的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059002012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各书 2:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59002012",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;你们既然要按使人自由的律法受审判，就该照这律法说话行事。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059002013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各书 2:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59002013",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;因为那不怜悯人的，也要受无怜悯的审判；怜悯原是向审判夸胜。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059002014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各书 2:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59002014",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;我的弟兄们，若有人说自己有信心，却没有行为，有什么益处呢？这信心能救他吗？</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059002015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各书 2:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59002015",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;若是弟兄或是姊妹，赤身露体，又缺了日用的饮食；</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059002016",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各书 2:16",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59002016",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>16</sup>&nbsp;你们中间有人对他们说：「平平安安地去吧！愿你们穿得暖，吃得饱」，却不给他们身体所需用的，这有什么益处呢？</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059002017",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各书 2:17",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59002017",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>17</sup>&nbsp;这样，信心若没有行为就是死的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059002018",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各书 2:18",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59002018",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>18</sup>&nbsp;必有人说：「你有信心，我有行为；你将你没有行为的信心指给我看，我便借着我的行为，将我的信心指给你看。」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059002019",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各书 2:19",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59002019",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>19</sup>&nbsp;你信　神只有一位，你信的不错；鬼魔也信，却是战惊。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059002020",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各书 2:20",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59002020",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>20</sup>&nbsp;虚浮的人哪，你愿意知道没有行为的信心是死的吗？</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059002021",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各书 2:21",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59002021",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>21</sup>&nbsp;我们的祖宗亚伯拉罕把他儿子以撒献在坛上，岂不是因行为称义吗？</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059002022",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各书 2:22",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59002022",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>22</sup>&nbsp;可见，信心是与他的行为并行，而且信心因着行为才得成全。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059002023",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各书 2:23",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59002023",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>23</sup>&nbsp;这就应验经上所说：「亚伯拉罕信　神，这就算为他的义。」他又得称为　神的朋友。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059002024",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各书 2:24",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59002024",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>24</sup>&nbsp;这样看来，人称义是因着行为，不是单因着信。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059002025",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各书 2:25",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59002025",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>25</sup>&nbsp;妓女喇合接待使者，又放他们从别的路上出去，不也是一样因行为称义吗？</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059002026",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各书 2:26",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59002026",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>26</sup>&nbsp;身体没有灵魂是死的，信心没有行为也是死的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059003001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各书 3:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59003001",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;我的弟兄们，不要多人作师傅，因为晓得我们要受更重的判断。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059003002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各书 3:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59003002",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;原来我们在许多事上都有过失；若有人在话语上没有过失，他就是完全人，也能勒住自己的全身。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059003003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各书 3:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59003003",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;我们若把嚼环放在马嘴里，叫它顺服，就能调动它的全身。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059003004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各书 3:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59003004",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;看哪，船只虽然甚大，又被大风催逼，只用小小的舵，就随着掌舵的意思转动。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059003005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各书 3:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59003005",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;这样，舌头在百体里也是最小的，却能说大话。 看哪，最小的火能点着最大的树林。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059003006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各书 3:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59003006",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;舌头就是火，在我们百体中，舌头是个罪恶的世界，能污秽全身，也能把生命的轮子点起来，并且是从地狱里点着的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059003007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各书 3:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59003007",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;各类的走兽、飞禽、昆虫、水族，本来都可以制伏，也已经被人制伏了；</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059003008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各书 3:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59003008",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;惟独舌头没有人能制伏，是不止息的恶物，满了害死人的毒气。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059003009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各书 3:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59003009",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;我们用舌头颂赞那为主、为父的，又用舌头咒诅那照着　神形象被造的人。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059003010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各书 3:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59003010",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;颂赞和咒诅从一个口里出来！我的弟兄们，这是不应当的！</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059003011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各书 3:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59003011",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;泉源从一个眼里能发出甜苦两样的水吗？</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059003012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各书 3:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59003012",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;我的弟兄们，无花果树能生橄榄吗？葡萄树能结无花果吗？咸水里也不能发出甜水来。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059003013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各书 3:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59003013",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;你们中间谁是有智慧有见识的呢？他就当在智慧的温柔上显出他的善行来。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059003014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各书 3:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59003014",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;你们心里若怀着苦毒的嫉妒和纷争，就不可自夸，也不可说谎话抵挡真道。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059003015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各书 3:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59003015",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;这样的智慧不是从上头来的，乃是属地的，属情欲的，属鬼魔的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059003016",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各书 3:16",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59003016",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>16</sup>&nbsp;在何处有嫉妒、纷争，就在何处有扰乱和各样的坏事。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059003017",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各书 3:17",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59003017",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>17</sup>&nbsp;惟独从上头来的智慧，先是清洁，后是和平，温良柔顺，满有怜悯，多结善果，没有偏见，没有假冒。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059003018",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各书 3:18",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59003018",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>18</sup>&nbsp;并且使人和平的，是用和平所栽种的义果。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059004001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各书 4:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59004001",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;你们中间的争战斗殴是从哪里来的呢？不是从你们百体中战斗之私欲来的吗？</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059004002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各书 4:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59004002",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;你们贪恋，还是得不着；你们杀害嫉妒，又斗殴争战，也不能得。你们得不着，是因为你们不求。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059004003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各书 4:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59004003",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;你们求也得不着，是因为你们妄求，要浪费在你们的宴乐中。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059004004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各书 4:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59004004",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;你们这些淫乱的人哪，岂不知与世俗为友就是与　神为敌吗？所以凡想要与世俗为友的，就是与　神为敌了。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059004005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各书 4:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59004005",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;你们想经上所说是徒然的吗？　神所赐、住在我们里面的灵，是恋爱至于嫉妒吗？</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059004006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各书 4:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59004006",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;但他赐更多的恩典，所以经上说： 　神阻挡骄傲的人， 赐恩给谦卑的人。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059004007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各书 4:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59004007",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;故此，你们要顺服　神。务要抵挡魔鬼，魔鬼就必离开你们逃跑了。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059004008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各书 4:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59004008",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;你们亲近　神，　神就必亲近你们。有罪的人哪，要洁净你们的手！心怀二意的人哪，要清洁你们的心！</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059004009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各书 4:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59004009",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;你们要愁苦、悲哀、哭泣，将喜笑变作悲哀，欢乐变作愁闷。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059004010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各书 4:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59004010",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;务要在主面前自卑，主就必叫你们升高。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059004011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各书 4:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59004011",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;弟兄们，你们不可彼此批评。人若批评弟兄，论断弟兄，就是批评律法，论断律法。你若论断律法，就不是遵行律法，乃是判断人的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059004012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各书 4:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59004012",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;设立律法和判断人的，只有一位，就是那能救人也能灭人的。你是谁，竟敢论断别人呢？</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059004013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各书 4:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59004013",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;嗐！你们有话说：「今天明天我们要往某城里去，在那里住一年，做买卖得利。」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059004014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各书 4:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59004014",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;其实明天如何，你们还不知道。你们的生命是什么呢？你们原来是一片云雾，出现少时就不见了。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059004015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各书 4:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59004015",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;你们只当说：「主若愿意，我们就可以活着，也可以做这事，或做那事。」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059004016",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各书 4:16",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59004016",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>16</sup>&nbsp;现今你们竟以张狂夸口；凡这样夸口都是恶的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059004017",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各书 4:17",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59004017",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>17</sup>&nbsp;人若知道行善，却不去行，这就是他的罪了。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059005001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各书 5:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59005001",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;嗐！你们这些富足人哪，应当哭泣、号咷，因为将有苦难临到你们身上。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059005002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各书 5:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59005002",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;你们的财物坏了，衣服也被虫子咬了。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059005003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各书 5:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59005003",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;你们的金银都长了锈；那锈要证明你们的不是，又要吃你们的肉，如同火烧。你们在这末世只知积攒钱财。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059005004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各书 5:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59005004",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;工人给你们收割庄稼，你们亏欠他们的工钱，这工钱有声音呼叫，并且那收割之人的冤声已经入了万军之主的耳了。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059005005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各书 5:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59005005",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;你们在世上享美福，好宴乐，当宰杀的日子竟娇养你们的心。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059005006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各书 5:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59005006",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;你们定了义人的罪，把他杀害，他也不抵挡你们。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059005007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各书 5:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59005007",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;弟兄们哪，你们要忍耐，直到主来。看哪，农夫忍耐等候地里宝贵的出产，直到得了秋雨春雨。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059005008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各书 5:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59005008",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;你们也当忍耐，坚固你们的心，因为主来的日子近了。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059005009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各书 5:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59005009",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;弟兄们，你们不要彼此埋怨，免得受审判。看哪，审判的主站在门前了。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059005010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各书 5:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59005010",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;弟兄们，你们要把那先前奉主名说话的众先知当作能受苦能忍耐的榜样。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059005011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各书 5:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59005011",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;那先前忍耐的人，我们称他们是有福的。你们听见过约伯的忍耐，也知道主给他的结局，明显主是满心怜悯，大有慈悲。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059005012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各书 5:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59005012",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;我的弟兄们，最要紧的是不可起誓；不可指着天起誓，也不可指着地起誓，无论何誓都不可起。你们说话，是，就说是；不是，就说不是，免得你们落在审判之下。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059005013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各书 5:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59005013",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;你们中间有受苦的呢，他就该祷告；有喜乐的呢，他就该歌颂。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059005014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各书 5:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59005014",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;你们中间有病了的呢，他就该请教会的长老来；他们可以奉主的名用油抹他，为他祷告。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059005015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各书 5:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59005015",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;出于信心的祈祷要救那病人，主必叫他起来；他若犯了罪，也必蒙赦免。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059005016",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各书 5:16",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59005016",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>16</sup>&nbsp;所以你们要彼此认罪，互相代求，使你们可以得医治。义人祈祷所发的力量是大有功效的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059005017",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各书 5:17",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59005017",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>17</sup>&nbsp;以利亚与我们是一样性情的人，他恳切祷告，求不要下雨，雨就三年零六个月不下在地上。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059005018",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各书 5:18",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59005018",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>18</sup>&nbsp;他又祷告，天就降下雨来，地也生出土产。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059005019",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各书 5:19",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59005019",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>19</sup>&nbsp;我的弟兄们，你们中间若有失迷真道的，有人使他回转，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10059005020",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "雅各书 5:20",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "59005020",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>20</sup>&nbsp;这人该知道：叫一个罪人从迷路上转回便是救一个灵魂不死，并且遮盖许多的罪。</p>"
  }
]